                                                "sense_id": "9def6ac2-9d81-3e61-95f4-be8da10b7e12",
                                                "text": "From Stettin in the Baltic to Trieste in the Adriatic an iron curtain has descended across the Continent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccd02cb4-414d-4e8f-9715-4006628e902e",
                                                "sense_id": "9def6ac2-9d81-3e61-95f4-be8da10b7e12",
                                                "text": "From January 1, 1954, Odra Port was discontinued as a ferry terminal, and the [sleeping] car then ran via Sassnitz, Neubrandenburg, Grambow and Stettin until June, 1956, when it was diverted via Berlin."
                                            }
                                        ]
